//! Singularity Economy Model v2 — systems-dynamics core (Meadows formalization).
//!
//! 1:1 port of `../../model_v2.py`. The Python implementation is the
//! specification; `tests/parity.rs` enforces agreement against golden vectors
//! generated by it. Design rationale: `../../meadows_design.md`.
//!
//! Loops (each with an ablation gain in [`Loops`]):
//!   B1 supply response, B2 displacement backlash, B3 affordability,
//!   R1 saturating recursive AI, R2 robot bootstrap, R3 capex momentum,
//!   B4 credit discipline.

use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};

